    "Compressed memory is live data owned by running apps; it only shrinks when they release caches or quit. Quitting a heavy app above immediately frees its compressed and swapped pages.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已压缩内存是运行中 App 的活动数据，只有 App 释放缓存或退出时才会减少。退出上方的高占用 App 会直接释放其已压缩与交换部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
