          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机保存的 iPhone 与 iPad 备份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS blocked the background service from opening your Trash. Review Full Disk Access for WonderBox. Administrator authorization alone does not grant this access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 阻止后台服务访问废纸篓，请检查 WonderBox 的完全磁盘访问权限。管理员授权并不包含此权限。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "stale"
    },
    "macOS blocked the background service's file access. Review Full Disk Access and App Management for WonderBox, then retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 阻止后台服务访问文件，请检查 WonderBox 的完全磁盘访问和应用管理权限后重试。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "stale"
    },
    "macOS denied the background service access to your Trash. This does not establish whether WonderBox has Full Disk Access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 拒绝后台服务访问废纸篓。这并不表示 WonderBox 未获完全磁盘访问权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS denied the background service's file operation. Export diagnostic logs from Settings to investigate the cause.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 拒绝了后台服务的文件操作。可从设置导出诊断日志以排查原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
